    {
      "id": "u063",
      "episode": 6,
      "sourceField": "intro",
      "kind": "quote",
      "raw": "アッシュ：壁に、ふたりの影が残ってる。",
      "text": "壁に、ふたりの影が残ってる。",
      "voice": "media/firstcut04-u063.wav",
      "sha256": "211a13cc55fbb232460d4c8873f2ad6025e9c7c4bb00390283961954d8081105",
      "duration": 2.3146666666666667,
      "start": 40.36666666666667,
      "end": 43,
      "game": "media/ep06-game.mp4",
      "gameAt": 27.8
    },
    {
      "id": "u064",
      "episode": 6,
      "sourceField": "intro",
      "kind": "quote",
      "raw": "ルミ：背の低いほうが私。すぐ追いつくって言ったね。",
      "text": "背の低いほうが私。すぐ追いつくって言ったね。",
      "voice": "media/firstcut04-u064.wav",
      "sha256": "10d15a9f8db24836c43f71de08fdca2d025c13f0ebda35944dc24f3a18dbe741",
      "duration": 3.392,
      "start": 43,
      "end": 46.7,
      "game": "media/ep06-game.mp4",
      "gameAt": 30.5
    },
    {
      "id": "u065",
      "episode": 6,
      "sourceField": "outro",
      "kind": "quote",
      "raw": "アッシュ：俺が会いに行くのは、どんな顔の子だっけ。",
      "text": "俺が会いに行くのは、どんな顔の子だっけ。",
      "voice": "media/firstcut04-u065.wav",
      "sha256": "a06b203766857012319cac46308e0baa2b8fdfef0861569f6e24bb77ca92bee1",
      "duration": 2.7946666666666666,
      "start": 46.7,
      "end": 49.8,
      "game": "media/ep06-game.mp4",
      "gameAt": 33.2
    },
    {
      "id": "u066",
      "episode": 6,
      "sourceField": "outro",
      "kind": "quote",
      "raw": "ルミ：顔がわからなくても、待ってる人はいるよ。",
      "text": "顔がわからなくても、待ってる人はいるよ。",
      "voice": "media/firstcut04-u066.wav",
      "sha256": "5a642fe1d93ec2344a1c65e2861bc78c83d0e4c841fe04b4211696ee4d6e752d",
